#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Expose Chamber WebUI to the public internet safely for **single-user** personal use.\n"
"> Prerequisites: domain on Cloudflare, Zero Trust team, Google (or other IdP) for Access login.\n"
"> Security context: [`security.md`](security.md) · install: [`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:14
msgid ""
"FreeAnima can publish `127.0.0.1:2658` via **Cloudflare Tunnel** "
"(`cloudflared`) with **Cloudflare Access** authentication at the edge. Login "
"happens on Cloudflare (e.g. Google), not in FreeAnima."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:20
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Surface            | Doc                                                                         |\n"
#| "| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Hub HTTP / WebUI   | [security.md](../guide/security.md)                                         |\n"
#| "| Credentials (pass) | [security.md](../guide/security.md), [identity.md](../concepts/identity.md) |\n"
#| "| Tool execution     | [tools.md](tools.md)                                                        |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer                    | Role                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Cloudflare Access        | User login, Allow policy (your email)                                   |\n"
"| cloudflared              | Outbound tunnel to local Hub                                            |\n"
"| FreeAnima JWT middleware | Validates `Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion`; loopback direct access still works |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 界面               | 文档                                                                        |\n"
"| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Hub HTTP / WebUI   | [security.md](../guide/security.md)                                         |\n"
"| 凭证（pass）       | [security.md](../guide/security.md)、[identity.md](../concepts/identity.md) |\n"
"| 工具执行           | [tools.md](tools.md)                                                        |\n"

